"[HEADER] Installation Infos",
"kill",
"When you click 'START SETUP' in the 'SETUP' tab, slime_rancher_2.apworld will be installed and moved into the 'custom_worlds' folder inside the Archipelago Launcher directory. BepInEx & dotnet will then be installed into the game's core folder. The required AP Mod's DLLs will be installed inside the Mods directory.",
